---
---

<section id="plan" class="plan">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">料金プラン</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">お店の規模に合わせて、3つのプランをご用意しています</p>

    <div class="plan-grid">
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-header">
          <h3>ライト</h3>
          <div class="plan-price"><span class="price-num">4</span><span class="price-range">〜6</span>万円<span class="tax">（税込・目安）</span></div>
          <p class="plan-desc">シンプルにまず始めたい方に</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="included">3〜4ページ構成</li>
          <li class="included">文章・コピー作成</li>
          <li class="included">スマホ対応</li>
          <li class="included">お問い合わせフォーム</li>
          <li class="not-included">Google Map</li>
          <li class="not-included">SEO設定</li>
          <li class="not-included">Google Analytics設置</li>
          <li class="not-included">Instagram連携</li>
          <li class="not-included">予約サービス連携</li>
          <li class="not-included">LINE誘導ボタン</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="plan-btn">相談する</a>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-card recommended">
        <div class="recommend-badge">おすすめ</div>
        <div class="plan-header">
          <h3>スタンダード</h3>
          <div class="plan-price"><span class="price-num">8</span><span class="price-range">〜10</span>万円<span class="tax">（税込・目安）</span></div>
          <p class="plan-desc">しっかり情報を伝えたい方に</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="included">5〜7ページ構成</li>
          <li class="included">文章・コピー作成</li>
          <li class="included">スマホ対応</li>
          <li class="included">お問い合わせフォーム</li>
          <li class="included">Google Map</li>
          <li class="included">SEO設定</li>
          <li class="included">Google Analytics設置</li>
          <li class="included">Instagram連携</li>
          <li class="not-included">予約サービス連携</li>
          <li class="not-included">LINE誘導ボタン</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="plan-btn primary">相談する</a>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-header">
          <h3>プレミアム</h3>
          <div class="plan-price"><span class="price-num">12</span><span class="price-range">〜15</span>万円<span class="tax">（税込・目安）</span></div>
          <p class="plan-desc">こだわりのサイトを作りたい方に</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="included">8ページ以上</li>
          <li class="included">文章・コピー作成</li>
          <li class="included">スマホ対応</li>
          <li class="included">お問い合わせフォーム</li>
          <li class="included">Google Map</li>
          <li class="included">SEO設定</li>
          <li class="included">Google Analytics設置</li>
          <li class="included">Instagram連携</li>
          <li class="included">予約サービス連携</li>
          <li class="included">LINE誘導ボタン</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="plan-btn">相談する</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="plan-note">※ 料金は目安です。ヒアリング後に正式お見積もりをお出しします。<br/>※ デザインは応相談。好みに合わせて対応します。<br/>※ ドメイン費用（年間約1,500円）のみ別途お客様負担。月額費用はかかりません。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .plan {
    padding: var(--section-padding);
    background: #f3f0eb;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .plan-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .plan-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .plan-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .plan-card.recommended {
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(91, 140, 110, 0.15);
  }

  .recommend-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.3rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .plan-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .plan-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .plan-price {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .price-num {
    font-family: var(--font-en);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .price-range {
    font-family: var(--font-en);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .tax {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .plan-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .plan-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .plan-features li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding-left: 1.8rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .plan-features li.included::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .plan-features li.not-included {
    color: #ccc;
  }

  .plan-features li.not-included::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  .plan-btn {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .plan-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .plan-btn.primary {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .plan-btn.primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .plan-note {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .plan-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
